{"version":1,"width":1080,"height":1350,"html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"nl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"loveke-size\" content=\"1080x1350\">\n<title>Wat is een Loveke</title>\n<style>/* Loveke Instagram-huisstijl. Lettertypes lokaal (fontsource), geen netwerk nodig. */\n@font-face{font-family:'Lilita One';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/lilita-one-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n:root{--cream:#FFF8F0;--black:#1A1A1A;--orange:#FF7033;--yellow:#FFD43D;--red:#E3404B;--pink:#FF85A1}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0}\n.wm{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E3404B 0%,#FF7033 55%,#FFC93D 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}\n.dots{background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(26,26,26,.10) 2.5px,transparent 2.5px);background-size:22px 22px}\n/* Plek voor een Instagram-sticker (poll, link, vraag, aftelling): leeg in de export. */\n.slot{visibility:hidden}\n</style>\n\n</head>\n<body>\n<div style=\"width: 1080px; height: 1350px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #1A1A1A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 90px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; color: #1A1A1A\">\n<div style=\"width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFF8F0; border: 6px solid #FFF8F0; border-radius: 36px; padding: 84px 76px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 34px; box-shadow: 16px 16px 0 #FF7033\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap\">\n<div class=\"wm\" style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 150px; line-height: 1\">Loveke</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 40px; color: #6B6B6B; font-style: italic\" data-slot=\"uitspraak\" data-label=\"Uitspraak\" data-max=\"23\">/ˈlʌv.kə/ · zn.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height: 6px; width: 160px; background: #FF7033; border-radius: 3px\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 26px; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.35\">\n<div><span style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; color: #FF7033\">1.</span> <span data-slot=\"betekenis1\" data-label=\"Betekenis 1\" data-max=\"69\">Vlaams koosnaampje voor je lief. Schatje, liefje.</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; color: #FF7033\">2.</span> <span data-slot=\"betekenis2\" data-label=\"Betekenis 2\" data-max=\"99\">Het woord dat Akke en Nastya bleven gebruiken, van Bratislava tot Kyiv.</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; color: #FF7033\">3.</span> <span data-slot=\"betekenis3\" data-label=\"Betekenis 3\" data-max=\"57\">Belgische streetwear, geboren uit liefde.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-weight: 700; font-size: 58px; color: #E3404B; margin-top: 10px\" data-slot=\"afsluiter\" data-label=\"Afsluiter\" data-max=\"29\">\"Wie is jouw Loveke?\"</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}